@overheard deck2
// Writer 5, batch 7. Deck 2 off duty: the senior corridor and the portrait gallery, the observatory, the chart room,
// the Watch office's view. Mostly not about work. Lines naming a crew member keep that person out (!who:/!with:).

== overheard
? pair:any+any place:senior_corridor
A: Which one's Captain Moro?
B: Third along. The one frowning.
A: They're all frowning.
B: Third along frowns most.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:senior_corridor !who:marrow !with:marrow
A: The Captain doesn't like her portrait.
B: It's a good portrait.
A: That's what everyone tells her.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:senior_corridor time:night
A: Do you come this way on purpose?
B: It's quieter up here. Thicker carpet.
A: It is, isn't it?

? pair:any+any place:observatory time:evening
A: That one's a planet.
B: That's a smudge on the glass.
A: A very bright smudge, then.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:observatory time:night
A: How far's that one?
B: Further than home.
A: Everything's further than home.
B: Not the kettle.   #funny

? pair:any+any place:observatory !who:marrow !with:marrow
A: The Captain's been coming up here lately.
B: On observatory night?
A: Sits at the back. Asks good questions.

? pair:any+any who:tomas place:observatory time:evening
A: I've named that one.
B: Officially?
A: Not yet. It doesn't know.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:alvarez-luca with:mbeki-bo place:observatory
A: Gerald likes it up here.
B: Gerald's a cactus.
A: A cactus with taste.   #funny

? pair:any+any who:lemaire-nils with:ibarra-rafael place:chartroom time:night
A: There's a gap on this chart.
B: Got a name ready?
A: Three. I'm saving the best one.

? pair:any+any who:kim-yusuf with:alvarez-luca place:chartroom
A: Marra Station, before it was rebuilt.
B: Which time?
A: The first. It had a fountain.

? pair:any+any deck:2 time:morning !who:holt !with:holt
A: Holt's done his rounds already.
B: It's six o'clock.
A: He was done at half five.   #funny

? pair:watch+watch place:watch_office !who:tomas !with:tomas
A: Best view of the lift, this.
B: Tomas says that.
A: Tomas is right.

? pair:any+any who:ferreira with:takahashi-wen deck:2 time:evening
A: Veyli has nine words for quiet.
B: You said seven last week.
A: I've learnt two more.

? pair:senior+any deck:2 !who:vance !with:vance
A: The ready room step got the Commander today.
B: Again?
A: He says it moved.   #funny
